For transfers of pots over £10,500, you'll need to provide proof of identity and address to The People's Pension.
You'll need The People's Pension account number for the pension you want to transfer - you'll find this in your Online Account.
This needs to be started by the pension scheme you're transferring to, so you should speak to them first to get this started.
People's Partnership are not able to give you any financial advice. Any information we provide about our products and services is given to help you make your own decisions based on your circumstances. If you'd like personalised help on making the most of your pension savings or have any concerns about whether transferring your pension is the right decision for you, please contact an authorised financial adviser. To find a financial adviser, you can visit www.unbiased.co.uk , or www.moneyhelper.org.uk
