Where You've instructed Us to pay an Adviser Charge, then as soon as We take the money from Your Cash Account to pay Your Adviser, this is no longer Your money and it becomes due and payable by Us to Your Adviser. We will only facilitate payment of these charges once You have sufficient cleared cash in Your Cash Account.
