## Steps to stay scam safe

Scammers appear professional and it's becoming increasingly harder to spot the diference between something that's credible and something that's fraudulent.

The Pension Scams Action Group has put together a checklist to go through if you're ever approached about your pension.

Your pension is your future - keep it safe

